# libretranslate
msgid "**Supported distribution**: Arch, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora or CentOS Stream, where CentOS resolves ``qbittorrent`` through EPEL."
msgstr "**Υποστηριζόμενη διανομή**: Arch, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora ή CentOS Stream, όπου το CentOS επιλύει ``qbittorrent`` μέσω του ΕΠΕΛ."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Supported distribution**: Arch, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora or CentOS Stream, where CentOS resolves `qbittorrent` through EPEL."
msgstr "**Υποστηριζόμενη διανομή**: Arch, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora ή CentOS Stream, όπου το CentOS επιλύει `qbittorrent` μέσω του ΕΠΕΛ."

# libretranslate
