# libretranslate
msgid "Dive into a decentralized social experience with Mastodon, a vibrant platform that redefines online communication with its federated, community-driven approach. With a rich set of features focused on privacy, scalability, and customization, Mastodon empowers users to create, share, and interact in an open social network."
