msgid "LDAP rides the same broker path: Keycloak federates LDAP via ``svc-db-openldap`` and the broker reads the resulting Keycloak headers via ``oauth2-proxy``. Direct LDAP-to-PDS sync is NOT supported, the Keycloak federation layer is the single authority for user identity."
