msgid "This role deploys Pretix using Docker, automating the installation, configuration, and management of your Pretix server. It integrates with an external PostgreSQL database, Redis for caching and sessions, and an NGINX reverse proxy. The role supports advanced features such as global CSS injection, Matomo analytics, OIDC authentication, and centralized logout, making it a powerful and customizable solution within the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
